the character you want, role-play the way you want, and carry the battle to the enemy.\n\nThe design aspects of Neverwinter Nights 2 don't stop there, however. Past the campaign included with the game itself, Neverwinter Nights 2 also gives you all the tools you need to build your own modules, campaigns, and adventures for your friends - move buildings, terrain, script encounters, write dialogues, create quests and items - everything you need to create an epic adventure of your own is included in the toolset for you and any other worldbuilder to use.", "themes": [{"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 23, "name": "Stealth"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/neverwinter-nights-2", "videos": [{"id": 413, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "3PZwfMRM_2k", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3PZwfMRM_2k", "title": "Neverwinter Nights 2 Release Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/3PZwfMRM_2k/hqdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 31, "name": "Neverwinter Nights"}], "characters": [{"id": 15765, "name": "Lord Nasher"}, {"id": 15770, "name": "Axle"}, {"id": 15764, "name": "King of Shadows"}, {"id": 15831, "name": "Generic Female 1"}, {"id": 15791, "name": "Ammon Jerro"}, {"id": 4794, "name": "Cain"}, {"id": 15794, "name": "Nolaloth"}, {"id": 15783, "name": "Githyanki"}, {"id": 15780, "name": "Veedle"}, {"id": 15779, "name": "Balaur"}, {"id": 15782, "name": "PC Generic Male 4"}, {"id": 15808, "name": "Blooden"}, {"id": 15817, "name": "Isym Spirit"}, {"id": 15818, "name": "Amie"}, {"id": 15807, "name": "Zhjaeve"}, {"id": 15803, "name": "Vale"}, {"id": 15815, "name": "Tarmas"}, {"id": 15757, "name": "Qara"}, {"id": 15827, "name": "Hezebel"}, {"id": 15785, "name": "Vashne"}, {"id": 15788, "name": "Torio"}, {"id": 15838, "name": "Johcris"}, {"id": 15839, "name": "Marshall Cormick"}, {"id": 10453, "name": "Callum"}, {"id": 15829, "name": "Natale"}, {"id": 15755, "name": "Casavir"}, {"id": 15622, "name": "Marcus"}, {"id": 15760, "name": "Dory Beggar Girl"}, {"id": 15771,